# laplace-avatar frontend — environment variables
# Copy to .env (gitignored) and edit as needed.
#
# In dev (`pnpm dev`), leave VITE_PIPECAT_BOT_URL blank — the Vite dev
# server proxies /api, /start, and /sessions to localhost:7860 (see
# vite.config.ts). The proxy target itself is overridable via this same
# variable, so setting it to e.g. http://192.168.1.50:7860 lets you
# point dev at a bot running on another machine.
#
# In production builds (`pnpm build`), this becomes the absolute origin
# the compiled JS hits at runtime. If you serve the frontend from the
# same origin as the bot (recommended; one TLS cert, no CORS), leave
# this blank so the app uses relative URLs.

VITE_PIPECAT_BOT_URL=
